  "description": "While there is no clear origin or creator of the aesthetic, it is believed to be inspired by the recent popularity of old anime, Y2K aesthetics (particularly Frutiger Aero ), and renewed interest in religious aesthetics. In the anime Neon Genesis Evangelion, for example, Christian imagery is combined with sci-fi imagery.\n\nAlthough 'Cyber Angel' is the most popular name for the aesthetic, similar imagery to the aesthetic can be found under the names 'Digital Angel,' 'Internet Angel,' and 'Frutiger Angelic.'",
